ForeverVerse — Our Infinite Love Story (Streamlit)
Ultra-premium anniversary app: cinematic hero, live counter, timeline, gallery, love-letter studio + template generator, 100 reasons, quiz, countdown, surprise box, dreams planner, memory capsule, music upload, greeting-card PNG generator, grand finale.

Run
pip install -r requirements.txt
streamlit run app.py
Deploy (Streamlit Community Cloud)
git init && git add . && git commit -m "ForeverVerse"
Push to GitHub (never commit private photos/secrets).
share.streamlit.io → New app → repo → app.py → Deploy.
Notes
Session state is temporary; SQLite/uploads may not persist across Cloud restarts.
Feb 29 anniversaries: celebrated Feb 28 in non-leap years.
Quiz result is entertainment only.
Tests
pytest -q
